      "message": "This looks like a _special_ implementation of the Automaton compiler; why not simply define it here as such?\n\nExample:\n\n```\npubic static final EXAMPLE_AUTOMATON_COMPILER \u003d new RefRegexAutomatonCompiler() {\n   \n   @Override\n   public Automaton toAutomaton(String refPattern) {\n    if (isRE(refPattern)) {\n      refPattern \u003d refPattern.substring(1);\n    }\n    ParameterizedString template \u003d new ParameterizedString(refPattern);\n    String replacement \u003d \"_PLACEHOLDER_\";\n    ImmutableMap\u003cString, String\u003e params \u003d\n        ImmutableMap.of(\n            RefPattern.USERID_SHARDED, replacement,\n            RefPattern.USERNAME, replacement);\n    return new RegExp(template.replace(params), RegExp.NONE).toAutomaton();\n   }\n}\n```",
